OL,3,GNEWSAThe millennials swapping
OL,4,Adoom-scrolling for gardening
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Hannah Matthews lost her father
OL,7,Fand grandmother in the space of a year,
OL,8,Fshe found comfort in her back garden.
OL,10,F"My mind would be really busy, and I'd
OL,11,Fsuddenly be out here at 7am pulling up
OL,12,Fweeds," said the 31-year-old.
OL,14,FShe is now an enthusiastic gardener,
OL,15,Fand one of thousands of young people
OL,16,Fsharing their green-fingered ways on
OL,17,Fsocial media.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
