OL,3,GNEWSAThe millennials swapping
OL,4,Adoom-scrolling for gardening
OL,5,
OL,6,FHannah, who has more than 70,000
OL,7,Ffollowers on Instagram and TikTok, said
OL,8,Fthe gardening community was "booming"
OL,9,Fand represented a way of "recapturing
OL,10,Fsome space that feels less tense" on
OL,11,Fsocial media platforms.
